    <description>A massive crystal chamber made out of stabilized chronite, and filled with embersap. Allows a tribe to melt down common fabricated items back into usable resources.
The chronite of this structure allows it to handle any electrical current, but is unable to seperate both energies and physical materials at once.
A chronite capacitor is needed to drain items specifically of energy, or charge items.</description>
